# Commits that `git blame` skips.
#
# Each entry is the full hash of a format-only commit: a SwiftFormat or
# SwiftLint configuration change and the reformatted code, with no behaviour
# change. Add an entry in a separate commit after the format commit, with a
# comment that names the rule. The process is in
# Docs/adr/0003-format-change-process.md.
#
# Enable it locally once:
#   git config blame.ignoreRevsFile .git-blame-ignore-revs
#
# GitHub reads this file automatically.
